    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Problem\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/65cdaf48-8c60-4f28-a700-3d274308de11\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n``` lua\nvim.o.completeopt = \"preinsert\"\nvim.o.autocomplete = true\nvim.o.infercase = true\nvim.o.ignorecase = true\n```\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nshow preinsertted text, replace or redraw them while i type.\n\n### Nvim version (nvim -v)\n\nNVIM v0.12.5\n\n### Vim (not Nvim) behaves the same?\n\nno,vim9.1.1725\n\n### Operating system/version\n\nmacOS 15.7.8\n\n### Terminal name/version\n\nIterm2 3.7.1\n\n### $TERM environment variable\n\nxterm-256color\n\n### Installation\n\nhomebrew",
